classDiagram
    direction LR
    class CopySpec {
        <<inmutable>>
        +model
        +fields
        +copy(origen, vínculos)
    }
    class CASE_VERSION {
        narrative_context
    }
    class RUBRIC {
        name
        description
        active
    }
    class RUBRIC_CRITERION {
        competency
        title
        description
        max_score
        display_order
    }
    CopySpec <|-- CASE_VERSION
    CopySpec <|-- RUBRIC
    CopySpec <|-- RUBRIC_CRITERION
    note for RUBRIC_CRITERION "el clon recibe el valor por defecto de:<br/>weight (0), active (true), Rubric.version (1.0),<br/>CaseVersion.world_schema_version (1)<br/>— el peso personalizado se perdía al clonar"
